  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 5 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nRising fuel costs are a gentle reminder of the true value of location. Living within walking distance of fine schools is a rare and lasting comfort. In securing this home, you ensure a peaceful daily routine, free from the worries of morning traffic. Here, your children can walk easily to three of the region’s finest schools: Murrays Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nBuilt to stand the test of time, the residence features classic weatherboard over a strong concrete block base, fitted with double-glazed windows (except on the lower floor) for warmth and lasting peace of mind.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the main house is a bright and spacious living area where the kitchen, dining room, and two separate sitting rooms flow gracefully together. Facing the morning sun, these rooms offer lovely views across the sea, where ships pass quietly along the horizon. Upstairs, you will find three bedrooms, including a main bedroom complete with its own private bathroom and dressing room, alongside a second full bathroom for the family.\r\n\r\nThe lower level features a rumpus room, a fourth bedroom with an ensuite, and a versatile extra room ideal for a quiet study or home gym. Outside, there is an additional generous storage room.\r\n\r\nGenerous wooden decks both in the mid and lower floor, catch the sun from morning till evening, offering a serene place to rest and take in the surroundings. The garden is planted with mature fruit trees and flowering shrubs, attracting local birds whose song adds to the home's calm and welcoming spirit.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
